/// A guild roster row's line from the guild's newest addon roster snapshot (roster[].addon and pending[].addon on GET /v1/guilds/{id}/home; the snapshot is the outbox's roster_snapshot of POST /v1/addon/exports, docs/contracts/addon-v2.md contract 4). Always present, null when the guild has no snapshot or the newest one does not carry the character. A snapshot line is matched to a row by character name, any case: the snapshot's names carry no realm (a Name-Realm line drops its realm half), so the guild's realm is the row's; the first line of a name wins. level, spec, gear_gap and build are null unless the row's member gave gear consent (the home withholds spec and gear for a roster-consent member); seen_at and snapshot_at stay.
public struct GuildRosterAddon: Codable, Sendable, Equatable {
